cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator, please cite the associated project report."
title: "Scalable Capability- and Energy-Aware Clustered SW-LCB for Heterogeneous Spectrum Allocation in UAV-Assisted Emergency Communication Networks"
abstract: >-
  Discrete-time simulator of UAV-assisted emergency communication networks with
  LTE and IEEE 802.11b/g partially overlapping channels, comparing the proposed
  CEAC-SW-LCB scheme against random, greedy, UCB, decaying-epsilon Thompson
  sampling and SW-LCB baselines under time-varying interference.
